# ============================================================================
# RealtyCook Environment Configuration (Template)
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your live credentials.
# Standing Rule: The frontend ONLY calls our Next.js backend (/api/*).
# All third-party integrations (Supabase, etc.) are called strictly from the backend.
# Do NOT prefix secret keys with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# ============================================================================

